load-bearing audit defect: the WP certificate implements
p_grad * sqrt(E[det(H)^2 | grad=0]) * min(Cantelli, P_window), where the
Cauchy-Schwarz step requires sqrt(min(Cantelli, P_window)). GP landed the
certificate sources to Drive as raw byte carriers under its individual-upload
policy: verify_wp_witness_v1.py ID 1CpOHuNogHeS7sK5Ygxc8FfDBVTq7wczK
