9. REPAIR ROUTES FOR THE WP CHANNEL (recommendation for WO-064 Task A)
========================================================================
(i) sqrt-restored CS: pgrad * sqrt(D2) * sqrt(min(cant, Pw)). Valid, but
r^1.5-class -- destroys the O(r^3) remainder; fallback only, with the
theorem's remainder restated.
